This repository produces `vis42.mcpb`, an MCP Bundle that installs into Claude Desktop with a single click. The bundle contains a Node.js stdio-to-HTTP proxy server that forwards all MCP operations to `https://vis42.com/api/mcp`. Spec ref: MCPB MANIFEST.md + README.

